Description: NFC diagnostics, virtual tag emulation and magic-card cloning
 Read and inspect NFC tags (UID, ATQA/SAK, NDEF, memory), save them to a local
 vault, emulate saved tags as virtual cards, and clone UIDs to magic cards.
